---
const items = [
  {
    q: 'Do I need to install anything?',
    a: 'No. Slide runs in a current browser. Agents need a headset and a decent connection, and that is the whole setup on their side.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Who is it for?',
    a: 'Teams whose job is the phone: support, sales, billing, scheduling, dispatch. If calls come in and someone has to pick up, it fits.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What about recording and privacy?',
    a: 'Recording is opt-in per number, and callers hear a notice first. Recordings are encrypted, and the links to play them expire. The Security page has the details.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Can supervisors listen in?',
    a: 'Supervisors can see every queue live. Listening in and whispering to an agent is on the plan for the supervisor tools.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Does it work in more than one language?',
    a: 'The interface is built to be translated, and dates, times and currencies follow the viewer. Which languages ship first is still being decided.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How much does it cost?',
    a: "Per agent, per month, with plans for different team sizes. Final prices aren't set yet.",
  },
];
---

<section class="faq section" id="faq">
  <div class="container wrap">
    <header class="head reveal">
      <p class="kicker">Questions</p>
      <h2 class="h2">
        Good things to ask <span class="soft">first.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="lede">
        Something missing? <a href="/contact">Ask us directly</a>.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="list">
      {items.map((it, i) => (
        <details class="reveal" style={`--i: ${i % 3}`}>
          <summary>
            <span>{it.q}</span>
            <svg
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.8"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path>
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <p>{it.a}</p>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .wrap {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
    gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 96px);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .head {
    position: sticky;
    top: 112px;
  }
  .head .h2 {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: var(--text-3xl);
  }
  .head .lede {
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  .head .lede a {
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--line-strong);
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }
  .head .lede a:hover {
    text-decoration-color: var(--orange);
  }
  details {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  details:last-child {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  summary {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 24px 4px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 560;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }
  summary svg {
    flex: none;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    color: var(--ink-3);
    transition: transform var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out);
  }
  details[open] summary svg {
    transform: rotate(45deg);
    color: var(--orange);
  }
  details p {
    padding: 0 48px 26px 4px;
    max-width: 58ch;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .wrap {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .head {
      position: static;
    }
  }
</style>
